# Response chaining: {{Name.response.body...}} reads a previous block's response.

@base_url = http://localhost:8888

### Login
POST {{base_url}}/post
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### Get user profile (username from the Login response body)
GET {{base_url}}/get?user={{Login.response.body.json.username}}
Accept: application/json

### Get user orders (request URL from the Login response)
GET {{base_url}}/get?user={{Login.response.body.json.username}}&token={{Login.response.body.url}}
Accept: application/json

### Read a response header of a previous request
GET {{base_url}}/get?content_type={{Login.response.body.headers.content-type}}
Accept: application/json

### Chained request (two hops)
GET {{base_url}}/get?previous={{Get user profile.response.body.url}}
Accept: application/json
